Captions for shiraz-launcher.mp4. Music plays under the whole film.

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.000
[Music] This isn’t a phone.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.600
It’s a Mac.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.000
No emulator. No virtual machine.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.200
No Android system image.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.700
Just the app’s own code,
running right on Apple silicon.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:14.500
Swipe it.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.900
Drag it.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.300
Type in it.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:23.600
Keep every app in one launcher,
and browse thousands more from F-Droid.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:28.600
Paced to your display, at up to
a hundred and twenty frames a second.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.900
Shiraz. Android apps, on your Mac.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:36.000
Free, open source,
and just getting started.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.160
[Music fades]
